WEBVTT

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:01.130
and marketplace,

00:05:01.172 --> 00:05:04.133
one that helps people
find community, connections

00:05:04.175 --> 00:05:06.761
and mentorship in their various
fields and industries.

00:05:07.136 --> 00:05:09.305
This moves them closer
to financial stability,

00:05:09.305 --> 00:05:11.891
and they can trade their arts
and products in new ways,

00:05:11.932 --> 00:05:14.352
not just for money,
but through barter as well.

00:05:14.393 --> 00:05:16.604
We're challenging
the core tenets of capitalism

00:05:16.604 --> 00:05:18.230
that are rooted in individualism,

00:05:18.272 --> 00:05:20.483
capital accumulation and competition

00:05:20.483 --> 00:05:22.234
by creating a behavior change

00:05:22.234 --> 00:05:23.903
and system level change

00:05:23.944 --> 00:05:26.405
that prioritizes collaboration,

00:05:26.447 --> 00:05:28.699
resource sharing and community.

00:05:29.867 --> 00:05:32.119
One of the key consequences of colonialism